# Page inventory

The draft website at https://aquemi-official.github.io/aquemi-web/ has 27 pages built from this system. Aquemi offers a modular Purified Water package in PP with PVC pretreatment (pretreatment, RO, DI/EDI, distribution); the WFI, pure steam and biotechnology pages are retired to `content/retired/`. The repository is `Aquemi-Official/aquemi-web`; page copy lives in `content/pages.json`. Use this list when you design or write any page, deck or document so page names and structure match the site.

Every page is: NavBar, Hero, an optional SectionNav (pages whose blocks carry a short `nav` label, four or more), content sections, a closing navy Band, Footer, and the BackToTop button (shown once the reader is well down the page). The sections each page uses are listed below in order, each as `type (nav label, or heading when it has none)`; `closing` notes a `cta.include` checklist, `cta.returns` and an explicit `cta.proof`.

